+                # then yields O = acc / l_i. lse = m_i + ln(l_i), where
+                # l_i = Σ exp2((s - m_i) * log2e) = Σ exp(s - m_i), so
+                # ln(Σ exp(s)) = m_i + ln(l_i) = m_i + log2(l_i) * ln2. Stored in
